xixo tɛn ɔ mɛ tɔn (0230 UTC) ɖo jɔmɛhunjayitɛn ɔ ji bo su jomɛhunjayitɛn ɔ nu jɔmɛhun ajɔ tɔn lɛ.", "Jɔmɛ hun kuntɔ ɔ é ko tun dɔ Squadron Leader Dilokrit Pattavee tɔn wɛ.", "Xojlatɔ lɛ dɔ lɔkpa zocitɔ lɛ sin mɔnto ɖokpo fli ɖo azɔ yeṭɔn hwénu.", "Vidal ɖo xwe 28 bo byɔ Barça mɛ, nǔwiwá ɔ́ atɔn nɛ kó wá yi nɛ, bó gosín Séville tomɛ.", "Sín hwe e nu e Vidal wá Catalane tomɛ e ɔ́, bɔl'afɔsɔ́xo núwíwa 49 wɛ é xo nú bɔl'afɔsɔ́xó gbɛ́ ɔ́.", "Nǔwiwá ɔ́ bɛ́ ɖo Whitehall ji gan 11:00 ̀ mɔ̌, gan (UTC+1) tɔn kpan nukɔn gblotɛn e kponɔ Downing Street tɔn lɛ hɛn e. Fínɛ́ wɛ Gǎnhɔnyitɔ́ nukɔntɔn ɔ nɔ́ nɔ.", "Gan 11:00́ jɛn xo wa yi, bɔ mɛ e wa nǔwiwá ɔ́ tɛ́nmɛ lɛ́ é ján wayiwáyi ɖ'ali e ɖò totaligbe nú Whitehall e.", "É 11:20 ɔ, kponɔ lɛ ɖɔ nu mɛ e wá nǔwiwá ɔ́ tɛ́nmɛ lɛ e ɖɔ yě ni yi afɔzɔntɔ́-li ɔ́ jí, ɖɔ é jɛxá ɖɔ e ni mɔ̀ hwihwɛ ɖò nǔwiwá ɔ́ kpó gɔnu e ɖo na te zin wɛ e kpán.", "Gan 11:29 mɔ̌ ɔ, nuwiwá ɔ́ zín'agete bǐ zɛ Whitehall wu, gbɔn Trafalgar Square bó wá tɔ́n ɖo Strand, gbɔn Aldwych bó wá tɔ́n ɖo Kingsway jlɔ Holborn fí e toxóɖɔ́gbɛ́ hunjɛdonǔjitɔ ɔ́ nɔ́ ɖó kplé tɔn jlokokomɛ ninɔ tɔn ɖe ɖo aglasoésɔ́ɖójǐtɛn Grand Connaught Rooms e.", "Akɔ́nta adǎnfúnfɔ́n Nadal kpó Canada kpán tɔ́n ɔ́ xlɛ́ 7-2.", "É lɛ́ vɔ j'ayi kpé Raonic ɖò Open Brisbane tɔn.", "Nadal ɖù kɛ́n 88% ɖò bɔl'afɔsɔ́xo núwíwá ɔ́ mɛ bó lɛ ɖù 76 ɖ'azɔ̌ nukɔn tɔn ɔ mɛ.", "É xò bɔlu ɔ́ fó ɔ́, ko King of Clay ɖɔ: \"Awǎjijɛ wɛ gɔ́ mi ɖɔ un ko lɛ wa nǔwiwa taji lɛ sín vuvɔ nu. Un wa fí bó ná tɛ́nkpɔ́n ná ɖó ɖùɖ'éjí.”", "\"Panama papers\" ɔ́, xó wɛ́ nyí b'ɛ nɔ ɖɔ do ɖe nyǐ wemǎ yi livi wǒ mɔ̌ é e ejlá ɖò xójláwémá tɛn ɖò Mossack Fonseca, hwɛɖɔtɔ́ gbásá Panama to ɔ́ tɔn. Avuvɔ hwenu xwe 2016́ tɔ́n.", "Wěma ɖelɛ́ ɖexlɛ́ ɖɔ akwɛsɛxwetɛn wǒ- ɛnɛ d'alɔ dɔkunnɔ gegě bɔ yě hwla dɔkun Dɔla Amɛlika tɔn liva wɔbu-wɔ́bú dó gbɔ takwɛ kpodo gbetakɛ́n ɖevo lɛ.", "Glɛnsito sín xójláwémágɔ́nu The Guadian ɖɔ̀ Deutsh Bank wɛ dó do azɔ̌xwé 1200 yé zan bo do kpéwú bo dowà nu enɛ .", "Gbɛtakɛ́n súsɔ́ gegě tíìn ɖo gbɛ ɔ́ mɛ, hwɛsɛ́n bɔ ɖó nú mɛ gegě tin nyǐ bɔ togan Iceland tomɛ tɔn ɔ́ kpó Pakistan tomɛ tɔn ɔ́ kpó wè lɛ bǐ wɛ gbɛ́ tɛn e mɛ yé ɖè ɔ.", "Ma ɔ́, e ji'i ɖò Hong Kong b'ɛ́ yi azɔ̌mɛ ɖò kplɔ́nyijǐ alavɔ New York tɔn ɖ'ala e nɔ wa sɛnzɔ́ Harvard tɔn. É kó ɖó wemakoéwún e ylɔ ɖɔ \"Carte Verte\" fí nunɔ titeungbe Amerika to ɔ́ tɔ́n.", "Sɔmisɔmi hwénú ɔ́, mɛɖaxó Hsieh ɖɔ mɛɖaxó Ma hɛn ɔ́ é ná hɔn sín to ɔ́ mɛ zigidi hwènu.", "Hsieh lɛ vɔ xlɛ́ ɖɔ yɛzɔ̌ wa tɔ́ Ma ɖǒ wlɛnwín ɖagbe b'ɛ́ vɛ́ jlɛ́", "Kpó hwɛ do mɛ lɛ ɖè ɔ́, Ma ɖo ɖuɖeji ɖò tuto ɖe mɛ b'ɛ́ ɖó mimamɛ trɔlɔ xá Chine to ɔ́.", "Bɔluxotɔ́ azǎn ɔ́ jí tɔ́n wɛ́ nyí Alex Ovechkin Washington tomɛ tɔn.", "E do bíii 2 bó s'aji mimɛ 2 ɖo ɖuɖeji 5 - 3 Washington tɔn ɖò Thrashers Atlanta tɔn ji"], "orig_ids": [[14474, 199840, 237493, 6100, 122646, 212305, 680, 2661, 220596, 549, 1553, 220596, 236764, 538, 241160, 1920, 236765, 239578, 1123, 97282, 1205, 97282, 685, 239958, 238288, 30742, 239958, 238288, 545, 212305, 237493, 93171, 1124, 239958, 236757, 239578, 41805, 558, 239958, 236749, 751, 675, 239958, 238288, 1920, 18991, 558, 239958, 236749, 520, 239578, 173547, 1559, 212305, 239958, 212305, 239958, 4478, 1105, 236916, 538, 241160, 545, 4478, 538, 239958, 904, 3238, 35008, 1105, 236916, 538, 241160, 545, 538, 239958, 904, 239958, 80456, 518, 239958, 4478, 538, 239958, 520, 239958, 538, 241160, 545, 538, 239958, 904, 239958, 80456, 518, 239958, 4478, 538, 239958, 520, 239958, 538, 241160, 173547, 1559, 86106, 239958, 236749, 538, 241160, 545, 4478, 538, 239958, 904, 3238, 35008, 1105, 236916, 538, 241160, 173547, 1559, 520, 239578, 1559, 212305, 236859, 236787, 538, 241160, 545, 4478, 538, 239958, 904, 3238, 35008, 1105, 236916, 538, 241160, 545, 4478, 538, 239958, 904, 3238, 35008, 1105, 236916, 538, 241160, 173547, 1559, 520, 239578, 1559, 212305, 236859], [14474, 646, 241160, 236767, 675, 